[{"client_msg_id":"ed3fa1df-eed4-4c37-8406-da7ef9efdfb9","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"僕も体重が増えて頬がふくらんできたんですけど、頬は現状を維持しつつ体重を減らしたい。\nここから減らすとまたこけてしまう。","ts":"1632043346.222600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7xWI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2c3d894-9605-4f07-b04f-ef187ef2e876","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"人によるけど頬がこけますからね(凸が凹になる意味で)","ts":"1632043201.221700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F3E5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E372F20D-52A4-4440-99A2-63A13FFDA96F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"18kg は人相変わりそう","ts":"1632041260.220700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"su4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4017cd4d-942c-40b5-9786-b9acaab54913","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"めちゃめちゃ健康的に痩せたんやけどなw","ts":"1632041143.220200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zg/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5155612a-1f45-4643-be1d-93b57549b572","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"申し訳ないけど笑ってしまった","ts":"1632041105.219700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pcra"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8fb92d7-23b6-49b1-b858-9c630a5dcc1f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"まぁさすがに 18kg 減ってたら言われてもしゃあないかも。","ts":"1632041098.219500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rcIHG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebc06b41-1289-41f0-ac0f-877465050291","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ひさしぶりに会った人に、体重が減ってる僕見て「すいません、もしかして、ご病気か何かですか」って言われた。","ts":"1632041068.218700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"innocent","count":6,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U06BRP8VD","U013QL1RAPN","U81LLJ340","U7JL1UKKL","U01J7703PFT"]},{"name":"warau","count":4,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U023H98P3N0","U01BY3SDBRS","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HRn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eaed2ce6-8279-44ee-90f7-0e96cb90f5bb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"縦でも大丈夫なような対処があるハンモックもなくはないらしいが...","ts":"1632019640.216400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HmmtX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f93ccd1a-7f2b-4aec-8fc4-7153e0382a0c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u0026gt; ハンモックが船舶内での寝床として便利だった理由は、ハンモックは船の左右の運動と同調して動くので、寝ている間に床に落ちたり、床の上を転がっていってしまう危険がないためである。特に帆船が主流だった時代には、帆船は風向きによっては船体が斜めに傾いたまま進むため、常に船内の床が左右のどちらかに傾いている時間が非常に多かった。このため、寝床の水平を保つために必要だった。またハンモックは就寝時間を除いては取り外したうえで格納されるため、軍艦内の限られたスペースで用いるうえでも有効であった。\nおおー、これ全然知らなかった","ts":"1632019633.216200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UQX22KG9F"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"skF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e1ce003-d254-4d04-b6a6-0d270ea7f86e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8F%E3%83%B3%E3%83%A2%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF\u003e","ts":"1632019622.215700","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: ハンモック","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"ハンモック","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8F%E3%83%B3%E3%83%A2%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF","text":"ハンモック（寝網、英: hammock）または釣床（つりどこ、吊床）は、元は南米の熱帯地方で先住民が使っていた寝具の1種である。\n尚、保護帽における衝撃緩和のための部品もハンモックと呼ばれる。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/Hammock_040522.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8F%E3%83%B3%E3%83%A2%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8F%E3%83%B3%E3%83%A2%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tovK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"732c208a-423a-48a6-8741-f66fe0151394","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ほほう","ts":"1632019575.215000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"geFN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c7c2e92-ea23-4aba-a213-512d365068d6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ハンモックにはななめか横で縦がよくないとは聞くけど、ちょっと耐性的なのと姿勢があってない感じw","ts":"1632019552.214600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EBwMv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d56c867-f87d-45f8-aa9d-133ebbb84d6d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"寝方が下手w","ts":"1632019470.213800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DFJ+k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b45b97e1-49a0-4322-be16-cd7a1140cad2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"関係ないけどこのハンモック快適そうにみえて微妙に快適でなさそう","ts":"1632019461.213500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YT47"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e6a85d8-d0e7-400e-bb90-d7d3dcece29c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"でもけっこう広い範囲で取るんですね。地中海全般にある程度あるんだな","ts":"1632019453.213300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UFpb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5beff2f5-e4f4-45df-8653-c4f2b6fafecf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、それはよかったw","ts":"1632019433.212600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H0m6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3b6a6d4-8d48-42ae-bd85-fa589e8e2f58","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あ、いや、だからあえてイタリア人と書くことで、その文化の普及度合いを示したかったものと読み取って、なるほどなあと返答した流れでした","ts":"1632019421.212200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Toue"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87d1819c-603e-486b-b2ce-8e097341746c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A8%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF\u003e\n基本スペインなんだし、スペイン人でやるべきだったな...","ts":"1632019157.211500","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: シエスタ","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"シエスタ","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A8%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF","text":"シエスタ（西: siesta）は、昼休憩（13:00 - 16:00が目安）を指す言葉である。本来、siesta という言葉は、ラテン語の hora sexta（第六時）における sexta を由来とする。すなわち日の出を基準として「第6時」（日の出から6時間後）、つまり、おおよそ正午辺りの時間帯の意味である。ポルトガル語では、同語源の語で sesta（セスタ）と呼ばれる。\nsiesta は単なる昼寝を意味するものではなく、長い昼休みに何をしてもよいということである。つまり、起きていてもsiesta である。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Die_H%C3%A4ngematte.jpg/1200px-Die_H%C3%A4ngematte.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A8%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A8%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fI4n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e131a22-2069-4fd0-ba69-b271d1d07f51","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"なんかイタリア北部がフランスっぽいと言うか私らのイメージするようなフランスの元ネタ感があって\n南部が私らのイメージする砂漠でパスタ茹でちゃうようなイタリアだったかな","ts":"1632010080.211100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rgdl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cac0880b-73ed-4568-80bf-9304727042ed","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"南部でやる、みたいな話題があったけど、確認しきれはいないので、USO800かもしれません...","ts":"1632008323.209100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ieybv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a5a8828-9828-412a-b26e-350ac04c6cb0","type":